    {
      "content": "Yeah, I saw your email so I saw that you're doing a partial move and you guys are getting rid of a lot of this stuff so I just kinda wrote back to I kinda took a, a little time off the estimate but the main thing with us is that it's entirely time based to begin with. So if we're just doing those inventory items I would probably put it closer to four to five hours rather than kind of a, a longer day that I originally told you. But it mostly just depends on how much you all get done. So if it's, if it's just those inventory items and you guys disassemble everything and it's all, I imagine we should probably be able to beat the estimate and go quick but with the house, you know, there always some surprises and stuff. So that's why I left it kind of have five hours just in case.",
