      "name": "Ricky Rodriguez",
      "time": "2026-09-21T18:20:18.008717",
      "type": "moment"
    },
    {
      "content": "Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, that, this would be two movers and one truck. We general, one of our trucks is a 26 foot box truck so we could generally fit about a full 1700 square foot, three bedroom home on one truck. So, based on the inventory list you sent, I'm not really concerned for truck space at all.",
      "name": "Jack Davis",
