    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDivoT14ggM",
      "content": "Okay. Got it, that makes sense. And then are, are there any like surcharges. I imagine there because you mentioned there's like no hidden fees but we're looking at various estimates.",
      "name": "Ricky Rodriguez",
      "time": "2026-09-21T18:20:39.273717",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "No, nope, there is no credit card processing fees. There's no material charges. There's literally not a single other fee. There's not even a tax on that. It was, it is literally just the $210 an hour for however long the move actually ends up taking.",
