      "time": "2026-09-21T18:21:30.328717",
      "type": "moment"
    },
    {
      "content": "Right, and, and that's where it is with houses, like, if this is a normal house and we're moving everything and you guys weren't doing any of that, you know, prep work and stuff. I would probably say probably take closer to the full day but if you guys end up doing a lot of that, you know, disassemble moving the small items, moving the boxes and we get there, and it's just furniture items then we could probably stay closer to this four to five hour timeline with us. Since it's time based, it is very much just depending on, you know, what you want to use us for and what you want to do yourself. So if you guys you know, at some point decide that you know, you want to quit taking trips and you'd rather pay us for an extra hour or two to to move some extra boxes. That's totally fine. Just let us know, so whether we don't schedule any moves after your.",
